00:41:49.090 --> 00:41:50.870
We have a contractual obligation.

00:41:50.870 --> 00:41:52.690
We said we will not, that was
a big part of my business.

00:41:52.690 --> 00:41:54.190
That's why I'm so involved in politics

00:41:54.190 --> 00:41:55.120
because that's what I did.

00:41:55.120 --> 00:41:57.520
I have a lot more free
time now so it's like hey,

00:41:57.520 --> 00:41:58.940
I'll get involved with
this and fight for what

00:41:58.940 --> 00:41:59.773
I believe in.

00:41:59.773 --> 00:42:01.090
That's why I wrote a book.

00:42:01.090 --> 00:42:03.610
But the false equivalency of
being like well how are you

00:42:03.610 --> 00:42:04.520
different than Hunter Biden?

00:42:04.520 --> 00:42:05.580
How am I different?

00:42:05.580 --> 00:42:10.580
I was an international
businessman for the last 15 years.

00:42:10.700 --> 00:42:14.020
We stopped doing those deals
just so they could have

00:42:14.020 --> 00:42:16.570
