00:42:29.570 --> 00:42:31.560
Media, no no no, that's off limits.

00:42:31.560 --> 00:42:34.060
I wasn't off limits for
two-and-a-half years.

00:42:34.060 --> 00:42:35.600
Kids are off limits.

00:42:35.600 --> 00:42:38.090
Barron Trump's not off
limits, they hit him.

00:42:38.090 --> 00:42:39.847
Tiffany Trump who's in
law school, did nothing,

00:42:39.847 --> 00:42:43.650
just a nice kid going to
school, she's not off limits.

00:42:43.650 --> 00:42:45.610
I wasn't off limits when they
spent two-and-a-half years

00:42:45.610 --> 00:42:47.000
trying to throw me in jail for treason

00:42:47.000 --> 00:42:49.376
