What would the media do if
Donald Trump, Jr., did that?

00:43:07.900 --> 00:43:09.440
- But they said they didn't talk about it.

00:43:09.440 --> 00:43:13.110
- Obviously they didn't
mention the business.

00:43:13.110 --> 00:43:13.943
They knew nothing about it

00:43:13.943 --> 00:43:15.199
when they're playing golf together?

00:43:15.199 --> 00:43:17.620
I just say do the other thing.

00:43:17.620 --> 00:43:18.453
How about this?

00:43:18.453 --> 00:43:19.840
Let's go earlier in life.

00:43:19.840 --> 00:43:23.420
Hunter Biden gets a great job
at MBNA right out of school.

00:43:23.420 --> 00:43:25.810
Happens to be the largest
bank and the largest employer

00:43:25.810 --> 00:43:28.260
