00:44:04.988 --> 00:44:07.040
Testing positive for cocaine, you think

00:44:07.040 --> 00:44:07.873
they'd have a prob--?

00:44:07.873 --> 00:44:09.090
You think they'd give me the pass?

00:44:09.090 --> 00:44:10.690
People don't even hear about that.

00:44:10.690 --> 00:44:12.710
Turning in a rental car with a crack pipe

00:44:12.710 --> 00:44:13.543
and all of these things.

00:44:13.543 --> 00:44:18.100
The media would have a field
day, so much so I almost

00:44:18.100 --> 00:44:21.410
