if when they catch it.

00:44:21.410 --> 00:44:23.300
- [Dave] You've got a
real death wish, man.

00:44:23.300 --> 00:44:24.850
- The aneurysm that they
would have, no no no,

00:44:24.850 --> 00:44:26.910
it would be good for us
because it would solve

00:44:26.910 --> 00:44:28.320
the fake news media problem.

00:44:28.320 --> 00:44:31.335
Their heads would explode with outrage

00:44:31.335 --> 00:44:33.750
that there'd be none left
and we could get back

00:44:33.750 --> 00:44:34.810
to a reasonable discourse.

00:44:34.810 --> 00:44:37.010
So they try to do this false equivalency

00:44:37.010 --> 00:44:37.843
of what's the difference.

00:44:37.843 --> 00:44:39.520
I go that's the difference.

00:44:39.520 --> 00:44:41.140
Hunter Biden made millions of dollars

00:44:41.140 --> 00:44:43.890
through his father's
taxpayer-funded office,

00:44:43.890 --> 00:44:45.380
has all this other shade in the past

00:44:45.380 --> 00:44:46.360
and he's totally off limits.

00:44:46.360 --> 00:44:48.740
But you had no problem with
half of Congress saying

00:44:48.740 --> 00:44:51.480
that I literally committed treason,

00:44:51.480 --> 00:44:54.480
a crime punishable by death,
for taking a 20-minute

00:44:54.480 --> 00:44:55.570
unsolicited meeting.

00:44:55.570 --> 00:44:59.200
But Hillary Clinton can
go out, pay foreign agents

00:44:59.200 --> 00:45:01.180
to go collect dirt.

00:45:01.180 --> 00:45:04.510
Take that dirt through the
DNC, leak it to the FBI.

00:45:04.510 --> 00:45:07.130
The FBI then leaks it back to the press.

00:45:07.130 --> 00:45:10.230
The press writes their
outrage story which the FBI

00:45:10.230 --> 00:45:13.939
then uses as the basis of an investigation

00:45:13.939 --> 00:45:16.990
of individuals on a
campaign for the President

00:45:16.990 --> 00:45:19.283
of the United States which
started the whole Muller hoax.

00:45:19.283 --> 00:45:22.210
I mean where's the outrage?

00:45:22.210 --> 00:45:25.545
Not even the outrage, where's the story?

00:45:25.545 --> 00:45:29.520
You've got a couple guys,
Sarah Carter, Sean Hannity,

00:45:29.520 --> 00:45:31.070
Gregg Jarrett, a couple
of guys pointing out.

00:45:31.070 --> 00:45:34.010
But you'd think that
this would be big news.

00:45:34.010 --> 00:45:36.930
If you're a journalist
this is kind of a big deal.

00:45:36.930 --> 00:45:40.863
This is a legitimate coup
and they're just like

00:45:40.863 --> 00:45:42.222
we have nothing to see here.

00:45:42.222 --> 00:45:43.150
There's nothing going on here, guys.

00:45:43.150 --> 00:45:44.500
We're just gonna pretend
this never happened

00:45:44.500 --> 00:45:48.460
because it goes against what
they would like to happen.

00:45:48.460 --> 00:45:50.620
It goes against the DNC talkers.

00:45:50.620 --> 00:45:52.190
It goes against that media narrative.

00:45:52.190 --> 00:45:54.590
And since they've made
that cognizant decision

00:45:54.590 --> 00:45:56.950
to be the marketing wing of
the DNC we should actually

00:45:56.950 --> 00:46:01.480
look into them for
campaign finance violations

00:46:01.480 --> 00:46:03.240
because they're just literally
contributing millions

00:46:03.240 --> 00:46:06.443
and billions of free marketing to the DNC

00:46:06.443 --> 00:46:08.950
covering for their bullshit.

00:46:08.950 --> 00:46:10.691
- So who, in the course of all of this,

00:46:10.691 --> 00:46:12.530
I hear you on all of this.

00:46:12.530 --> 00:46:14.070
Who, in the course of all
this, do you and I guess

00:46:14.070 --> 00:46:16.800
by extension your dad,
actually take counsel from?

00:46:16.800 --> 00:46:19.868
I remember during the
Michael Cohen testimony

00:46:19.868 --> 00:46:22.010
it was one of the first
moments when I was like

00:46:22.010 --> 00:46:23.610
this Russia thing is complete nonsense.

00:46:23.610 --> 00:46:25.972
But the reason wasn't because
of anything that he said.

00:46:25.972 --> 00:46:27.550
It was because you were live tweeting it.

00:46:27.550 --> 00:46:30.830
And I was like if this guy
is guilty, meaning you.

00:46:30.830 --> 00:46:33.660
If you were guilty of
anything your lawyers

00:46:33.660 --> 00:46:35.660
or everyone you know
would be locking you up

00:46:35.660 --> 00:46:37.123
and putting you in a room
and taking your phone.

00:46:37.123 --> 00:46:39.678
Because you were live
tweeting it so freely.

00:46:39.678 --> 00:46:44.150
- It was funny, my lawyer's
like you can't do that.

00:46:44.150 --> 00:46:45.227
Anything you say.

00:46:45.227 --> 00:46:47.723
I'm like I don't care, I'm right.

00:46:47.723 --> 00:46:49.740
I don't care.

00:46:49.740 --> 00:46:51.810
This is bullshit and I'm gonna say it.

00:46:51.810 --> 00:46:54.070
So I literally had that conversation.

00:46:54.070 --> 00:46:55.512
I sat down with my lawyers numerous.

00:46:55.512 --> 00:47:00.260
I go, you guys are making
one critical mistake.

00:47:00.260 --> 00:47:02.940
If I sit down, if I just sit
in the corner and curl up

00:47:02.940 --> 00:47:05.756
in a ball and die, or cry sucking my thumb

00:47:05.756 --> 00:47:08.171
in the fetal position
that's what they want.

00:47:08.171 --> 00:47:10.970
You think they're gonna
go any lighter on me?

00:47:10.970 --> 00:47:11.803
They're not.

00:47:11.803 --> 00:47:13.960
Adam Schiff was on TV every
day saying I committed treason.

00:47:13.960 --> 00:47:17.220
He's seen evidence, to the entire country.

00:47:17.220 --> 00:47:19.690
He's seen evidence of treason
and collusion and all.

00:47:19.690 --> 00:47:21.880
I still haven't seen it.

00:47:21.880 --> 00:47:24.034
You'd think if he's
seen it no one else has.

00:47:24.034 --> 00:47:26.570
Maybe it's time to drop it by now.

00:47:26.570 --> 00:47:28.810
It wasn't in the Muller report.

00:47:28.810 --> 00:47:30.500
So I'm saying I'm just
not gonna do it, man.

00:47:30.500 --> 00:47:32.510
I'm not gonna just sit back.

00:47:32.510 --> 00:47:34.490
I get where you're going
from a legal strategy.

00:47:34.490 --> 00:47:35.770
I'm not naive to that,
it's not that I'm stupid.

00:47:35.770 --> 00:47:37.020
- I'm not saying that it
was the right thing to do.

00:47:37.020 --> 00:47:38.049
I'm just saying.

00:47:38.049 --> 00:47:40.650
- I get where they're saying.

00:47:40.650 --> 00:47:42.153
I go, I just don't care and
honestly at the end of it

00:47:42.153 --> 00:47:44.480
they go you know what, you were right.

00:47:44.480 --> 00:47:47.092
You needed to push back
because you could see it.

00:47:47.092 --> 00:47:50.110
I'm in closed door
testimony with the House

00:47:50.110 --> 00:47:51.800
Intelligence Committee right.

00:47:51.800 --> 00:47:54.190
And I come back, I'm out of
this thing after nine hours

00:47:54.190 --> 00:47:55.150
or so of testimony.

00:47:55.150 --> 00:47:57.610
I get out at seven o'clock at
night and I look at Twitter

00:47:57.610 --> 00:48:02.040
and CNN, at 11:59, Donald
Trump, Jr., was saying this.

00:48:02.040 --> 00:48:04.260
I go, Jesus Christ I mean
Adam Schiff is taking

00:48:04.260 --> 00:48:06.080
bathroom breaks and
leaking this stuff to--

00:48:06.080 --> 00:48:06.913
- [Dave] Closed door, closed door?

00:48:06.913 --> 00:48:07.947
- Closed door, it was
supposed to be totally.

00:48:07.947 --> 00:48:10.780
And I got back, I'm looking
back seven hours in advance.

00:48:10.780 --> 00:48:13.160
Every time we took a bathroom break CNN

00:48:13.160 --> 00:48:13.993
is breaking this stuff.

00:48:13.993 --> 00:48:17.500
I mean three of their big
bombshells had to do with me.

00:48:17.500 --> 00:48:20.980
Now they were all wrong,
they were all false.

00:48:20.980 --> 00:48:22.970
One of them was the WikiLeaks.

00:48:22.970 --> 00:48:26.370
Some random dude literally
DM'ed me or sent me an email.

00:48:26.370 --> 00:48:28.200
Like have you seen this?

00:48:28.200 --> 00:48:31.570
It was like whatever, let's
call it June 14th right?

00:48:31.570 --> 00:48:32.880
They leaked the stuff to CNN

00:48:32.880 --> 00:48:34.077
and I'm looking at the date stamp.

00:48:34.077 --> 00:48:35.938
Do you have comments on that?

00:48:35.938 --> 00:48:36.817
It was June fourth.

00:48:36.817 --> 00:48:40.470
I'm like holy shit they
deleted the one in 14, right?

00:48:40.470 --> 00:48:43.160
So the 14, you delete
the one, it becomes four.

00:48:43.160 --> 00:48:44.930
So the thing broke on like June 10th

00:48:44.930 --> 00:48:46.800
or whatever it was, right?

00:48:46.800 --> 00:48:50.190
So it looks like I had this
information from some random.

00:48:50.190 --> 00:48:51.534
It's a Trump donor, he
donated like 25 bucks

00:48:51.534 --> 00:48:53.830
and somehow spammed our email.

00:48:53.830 --> 00:48:56.170
So actually hit my email so it got there.

00:48:56.170 --> 00:48:58.263
I didn't respond, I didn't,
but it looked like them

00:48:58.263 --> 00:49:00.649
from the leaked email I
had it six days before

00:49:00.649 --> 00:49:04.077
rather than four days after
the rest of the freakin' world.

00:49:04.077 --> 00:49:06.880
Not different than sort of
me outing the whistleblower

00:49:06.880 --> 00:49:09.100
after it's been out there
in the public for four days.

00:49:09.100 --> 00:49:11.610
I'm just like oh my God, bombshell,

00:49:11.610 --> 00:49:13.020
Donald Trump, Jr., had it.

00:49:13.020 --> 00:49:16.090
I'm like here's the
tweets, here's the emails.

00:49:16.090 --> 00:49:17.900
How come where the only ones
being transparent, Dave.

00:49:17.900 --> 00:49:19.999
(both speaking at once)

00:49:19.999 --> 00:49:20.832
- An apology, did you ever get a call

00:49:20.832 --> 00:49:21.665
somebody in the media?

00:49:21.665 --> 00:49:22.835
- Not even a retraction on some of these.

00:49:22.835 --> 00:49:25.060
Michael Cohen was there.

00:49:25.060 --> 00:49:27.640
When Donald Trump, Jr., no
his lawyer pulled that one.

00:49:27.640 --> 00:49:30.160
His lawyer pulled it back
because they got it wrong

00:49:30.160 --> 00:49:31.600
and they're the guys leaking it.

00:49:31.600 --> 00:49:33.173
It's so asinine.

00:49:34.320 --> 00:49:35.153
Then they question about it.

00:49:35.153 --> 00:49:37.660
Now there was no
questioning about him then

00:49:37.660 --> 00:49:39.140
literally perjuring himself I think it was

00:49:39.140 --> 00:49:40.233
eight or nine times.

00:49:40.233 --> 00:49:42.640
(mumbles) I'm like nope, didn't happen.

00:49:42.640 --> 00:49:44.200
Check XYZ.

00:49:44.200 --> 00:49:46.530
I mean Jim Jordan, some
of them called it out.

00:49:46.530 --> 00:49:47.880
They sent the thing back to the DOJ.

00:49:47.880 --> 00:49:49.330
Be like, hey what about this?

00:49:50.470 --> 00:49:52.000
Nothing, we're not playing the same game

00:49:52.000 --> 00:49:52.833
and that's the problem.

00:49:52.833 --> 00:49:54.379
I mean there are some
Republicans that are doing it.

00:49:54.379 --> 00:49:56.200
There are some that
are learning from Trump

00:49:56.200 --> 00:49:57.840
because Trump has taught
conservatives hey,

00:49:57.840 --> 00:49:59.330
you can fight back.

00:49:59.330 --> 00:50:01.860
You don't just have to lose
'cause they want you to.

00:50:01.860 --> 00:50:03.890
You don't just have to give
up because they're going

00:50:03.890 --> 00:50:05.790
to write a bad story about you.

00:50:05.790 --> 00:50:08.143
But what the problem is that
mentality is still there.

00:50:08.143 --> 00:50:10.982
Like okay well you know, we're leave this.

00:50:10.982 --> 00:50:14.210
They would never give us that
same benefit of the doubt.

00:50:14.210 --> 00:50:15.992
I say hey, we can all play t-ball

00:50:15.992 --> 00:50:18.110
or we can all play hardball.

00:50:18.110 --> 00:50:20.250
But we've gotta be playing
the same game and we're not.

00:50:20.250 --> 00:50:22.210
- Do you ever fear that
that, or does your dad

00:50:22.210 --> 00:50:24.170
ever fear that that
game, so I agree with you

00:50:24.170 --> 00:50:25.970
on the premise that we
had to break this thing

00:50:25.970 --> 00:50:28.290
so that with could start
resetting the system

00:50:28.290 --> 00:50:29.320
in a sensible way.

00:50:29.320 --> 00:50:31.610
But the game of sort
of constant destruction

00:50:31.610 --> 00:50:32.890
one way or another.

00:50:32.890 --> 00:50:35.141
That's dangerous, ultimately.

00:50:35.141 --> 00:50:39.840
- It is, by the way I'd
love to break that game.

00:50:39.840 --> 00:50:41.090
But they're not gonna do it.

00:50:41.090 --> 00:50:41.980
You know what I mean?

00:50:41.980 --> 00:50:43.157
They have to work with
us a little bit on that.

00:50:43.157 --> 00:50:46.009
I mean the perfect example, the USMCA,

00:50:46.009 --> 00:50:48.760
the renegotiation of NAFTA.

00:50:48.760 --> 00:50:50.160
Everyone said it couldn't be done.

00:50:50.160 --> 00:50:53.530
It was the worst trade deal
